    <briefdescription>
<para>Base exception class for all training module failures. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides structured error information including error code, message, recovery flag, and diagnostic context. All public APIs of the training module throw exceptions derived from this base class.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="invariant"><para>All training exceptions are derived from <ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_training_exception" kindref="compound">TrainingException</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_training_exception_1a28d709e7710cdf765cc4d0ba98937cb7" kindref="member">error_code()</ref> always returns a valid <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1training_1a989d1a56dd341d79ec9a2e414c64841b" kindref="member">TrainingErrorCode</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_training_exception_1aeb0d1f8f5ba5b3bf4852702ae797aad1" kindref="member">is_recoverable()</ref> accurately reflects whether error is transient </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
